        <li>⚠️ <strong>Limited datacenter locations</strong> — only Ashburn, VA and Hillsboro, OR for managed VPS</li>
        <li>⚠️ <strong>No live chat on lower plans</strong> — ticket + callback workflow only</li>
        <li>⚠️ <strong>No Windows VPS option</strong> — Linux only</li>
